{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38911","headline":"塞上 · 杜荀鹤","name":"塞上","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旌旗鬣鬣汉将军，闲出巡边帝命新。\n沙塞旋收饶帐幕，犬戎时杀少烟尘。\n冰河夜渡偷来马，雪岭朝飞猎去人。\n独作书生疑不稳，软弓轻劒也随身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38911.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38911","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}